id:S048 a nr:BackupType_fafcd817Relation ;
    dct:source id:DMP ;
    nr:backupType_fafcd817Value "In addition to being stored in OSF, all data will also be stored on a USB flash drive that will be managed by the project leader at the location at which the research currently takes place (Tokyo, Oxford, Wellington or Graz). After the end of the project the flash drive will be stored at the Department of Philosophy of the University of Graz."@en .

id:S049 a nr:HasSecurityPrivacy_35e5e34dRelation ;
    dct:source id:DMP ;
    nr:hasSecurityPrivacy_35e5e34dValue id:datasetSecurityPrivacy .

id:S050 a nr:EthicalIssueDescription_fbe15109Relation ;
    dct:source id:DMP ;
    nr:ethicalIssueDescription_fbe15109Value "The only potential limitation to data-sharing could arise in the context of potential qualitative research which reveals demographic facts that might be used to identify participants. In the case of such research I will proceed as described above: de-identify the data (e.g., exclude references to a participant’s age or location) before uploading it to OSF, and, upon completion of the research, store the original data on a password-protected section of the above-mentioned flash-drive which can only be accessed by contributing researchers."@en .

